0f3XAaOcNhAz_ENo3vd/edit?gid=2144450313#gid=2144450313&range=A1","detail_source_row":"2","master_location":"東海岸","master_county":"宜蘭縣","master_name":"外澳觀光旅館","development_nature":"","review_progress_raw":"尚未通過環評","permit_progress_raw":"","master_competent_authority":"","jurisdiction_level":"地方","master_environmental_authority":"","master_area_scale_raw":"1.74公頃，其中0.7公頃的景觀保護區，計畫變更為乙種旅館區","master_area_ha":"1.74","facilities_raw":"3棟9間房、海景套房27間及SPA、樹林餐廳","master_investment_amount_raw":"6億","master_investment_twd":"600000000","master_notes":"宜蘭外澳海岸的保護區將變更為旅館區。觀光局表示，必須先經由都市計畫變更為旅館區，才可辦理承租。目前該計畫林姓業者委託山點水股份有限公司進行規劃、設計及提出申請。","controversy_text":"阻擋觀海視線、開發將危及當地海洋生態，影響漁民生計、該業主始終不曾與地方居民有所往來，未來飯店開張要結合在地特色發展觀光令人質疑等","related_report_label":"外澳保護區變旅館區 居民抗議","related_report_url":"https://e-info.org.tw/node/94933","master_source_row":"3"},"related":{"development_case_timeline.csv":[{"event_key":"timeline-55fc581790acffbf","source_feature_id":"mymaps-01b148b74926","source_order":"1","event_date_raw":"2006","event_date_start":"2006-01-01","event_date_end":"2006-12-31","date_precision":"year","phase_label":"","event_text":"榮梓博物館，是位於臺灣宜蘭縣頭城鎮外澳、林昭文擁有的私人招待所兼博物館，以阿拉伯風格建造，是當地著名的景點。地址是頭城鎮濱海路二段328號。約2005年時原先別墅拆除，2006年再成立","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"01外澳觀光旅館","source_sheet_gid":"2144450313","source_row":"7"},{"event_key":"timeline-e83b0474141f0ab0","source_feature_id":"mymaps-01b148b74926","source_order":"2","event_date_raw":"2010","event_date_start":"2010-01-01","event_date_end":"2010-12-31","date_precision":"year","phase_label":"","event_text":"因建築吸引遊客眼光，林家在2010年開始計畫發成觀光旅館，欲併購鄰近土地，把公有海灘劃入承租，以及興建23棟一晚收費2萬3千元到3萬元的觀光旅館。屆時若旅館啟用，博物館就會開放讓飯店遊客參觀。","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"01外澳觀光旅館","source_sheet_gid":"2144450313","source_row":"8"},{"event_key":"timeline-1b41ab5a7cfe7c54","source_feature_id":"mymaps-01b148b74926","source_order":"3","event_date_raw":"2013.11.11","event_date_start":"2013-11-11","event_date_end":"2013-11-11","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"外澳土地變更案內政部都委會第一次審查","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"01外澳觀光旅館","source_sheet_gid":"2144450313","source_row":"9"},{"event_key":"timeline-86a73be7d1222ec4","source_feature_id":"mymaps-01b148b74926","source_order":"4","event_date_raw":"2013.11.12","event_date_start":"2013-11-12","event_date_end":"2013-11-12","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"宜蘭外澳海岸的保護區將變更為旅館區，營建署昨（11日）召開審查會議，外澳居民組成的「守護外澳海岸」、「外澳社區發展協會」、宜蘭青年、學生及民間團體，在場外召開記者會表達堅決抵抗的立場。","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"01外澳觀光旅館","source_sheet_gid":"2144450313","source_row":"10"},{"event_key":"timeline-d7f4804c4a40c656","source_feature_id":"mymaps-01b148b74926","source_order":"5","event_date_raw":"2017.07.20","event_date_start":"2017-07-20","event_date_end":"2017-07-20","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"宜蘭頭城外澳海岸，之前就傳出有飯店業者打算將國有地申請變更為旅館用地，再承租興建旅館營利，但當時申請失敗，但最近業者卻悄悄開工，還圍起石牆、砍光原有樹木，涉嫌侵占國有地。","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"01外澳觀光旅館","source_sheet_gid":"2144450313","source_row":"11"},{"event_key":"timeline-9bb26836428e61a5","source_feature_id":"mymaps-01b148b74926","source_order":"6","event_date_raw":"2018.08.15","event_date_start":"2018-08-15","event_date_end":"2018-08-15","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"位於宜蘭外澳的「阿拉伯宮」榮梓博物館，正求售中!這座由「阿拉伯王」之稱林昭文斥資上億元，興建的博物館，曾招待前總統李登輝、前副總統連戰、台塑集團創辦人王永慶等人，現因林昭文身體每況愈下，妻子林楊桂蓮委託仲介，以33 億元求售，正待有緣人中。","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"01外澳觀光旅館","source_sheet_gid":"2144450313","source_row":"12"},{"event_key":"timeline-4bfca873672c527a","source_feature_id":"mymaps-01b148b74926","source_order":"7","event_date_raw":"2019.07.08","event_date_start":"2019-07-08","event_date_end":"2019-07-08","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"阿拉伯宮求售近1年，外界盛傳最近有外縣市建商以21億元高價，順利入主「阿拉伯宮」，入手價與去年開價相比，相當於折了12億餘元。對此，余文雄表示，目前八字還沒一撇，他沒聽過相關成交訊息，外界傳言是空穴來風。","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"01外澳觀光旅館","source_sheet_gid":"2144450313","source_row":"13"}],"development_case_timeline_source.csv":[{"timeline_source_key":"timeline-source-63dfe2b1686c3166","event_key":"timeline-e83b0474141f0ab0","source_feature_id":"mymaps-01b148b74926","sort_order":"1","source_label":"來源維基百科","source_url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/%E6%A6%AE%E6%A2%93%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A4%A8","source_sheet_name":"01外澳觀光旅館","source_sheet_gid":"2144450313","source_row":"8"},{"timeline_source_key":"timeline-source-4433161fa08b174d","event_key":"timeline-1b41ab5a7cfe7c54","source_feature_id":"mymaps-01b148b74926","sort_order":"2","source_label":"守護外澳海岸線/我們的島","source_url":"https://ourisland.pts.org.tw/content/1016","source_sheet_name":"01外澳觀光旅館","source_sheet_gid":"2144450313","source_row":"9"},{"timeline_source_key":"timeline-source-0be85a991df2c758","event_key":"timeline-86a73be7d1222ec4","source_feature_id":"mymaps-01b148b74926","sort_order":"3","source_label":"外澳保護區變旅館區 居民抗議","source_url":"https://e-info.org.tw/node/94933","source_sheet_name":"01外澳觀光旅館","source_sheet_gid":"2144450313","source_row":"10"},{"timeline_source_key":"timeline-source-8721e592575dbb57","event_key":"timeline-d7f4804c4a40c656","source_feature_id":"mymaps-01b148b74926","sort_order":"4","source_label":"「小白宮」築石牆砍樹　強佔外澳國有地","source_url":"https://news.tvbs.com.tw/politics/748367?fbclid=IwAR3GQyWjOl_0NajHIbFOpeY1ux5gIJLR-qWGtyrvW6G8IcXrECoSwB5i2e0","source_sheet_name":"01外澳觀光旅館","source_sheet_gid":"2144450313","source_row":"11"},{"timeline_source_key":"timeline-source-f429f07bee735042","event_key":"timeline-9bb26836428e61a5","source_feature_id":"mymaps-01b148b74926","sort_order":"5","source_label":"總統、巨富都來過 神祕「阿拉伯宮」不得不賣有原因","source_url":"https://www.chinatimes.com/realtimenews/20180815001553-260405?chdtv","source_sheet_name":"01外澳觀光旅館","source_sheet_gid":"2144450313","source_row":"12"},{"timeline_source_key":"timeline-source-b311e474c36647c5","event_key":"timeline-4bfca873672c527a","source_feature_id":"mymaps-01b148b74926","sort_order":"6","source_label":"宜蘭外澳「阿拉伯宮」傳以21億易主","source_url":"https://ec.ltn.com.tw/article/breakingnews/2845913","source_sheet_name":"01外澳觀光旅館","source_sheet_gid":"2144450313","source_row":"13"}],"development_case_media.csv":[],"development_case_source.csv":[],"development_case_discrepancy.csv":[]}}},{"data":{"title":"宜蘭大溪蜜月灣地區開發計畫","summary":"2011年已通過環境影響評估，至今仍未開發。根據蜜月灣提出的環差報告，將設置別墅區、住宅區及250間客房的旅館區，開發面積總共107.4公頃，是東北部地區最大的開發案。經營計劃分為4期、2階段開發，開發期程為15年。","county":"宜蘭縣","authority":"東北角暨宜蘭海岸國家風景區管理處審查","status":"重新環評","source_url":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1aESMD2YyrOcKd0f3XAaOcNhAz_ENo3vd/edit?gid=1996964847#gid=1996964847&range=A1","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[121.88944,24.938057],[121.887295,24.936734],[121.885492,24.937201],[121.881372,24.936967],[121.879827,24.931675],[121.879312,24.928017],[121.879913,24.926382],[121.883261,24.925059],[121.883604,24.924125],[121.88532,24.924358],[121.886007,24.925682],[121.887724,24.925682],[121.890814,24.937201],[121.88944,24.938057]]]},"sort_order":2,"timeline":[{"title":"宜蘭大溪蜜月灣進行環評審查","description":"宜蘭大溪蜜月灣進行環評審查","date":"1998","date_precision":"year","source_url":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1aESMD2YyrOcKd0f3XAaOcNhAz_ENo3vd/edit?gid=1996964847#gid=1996964847&range=A1","sort_order":1,"status":"","is_published":false},{"title":"有條件通過環評審查","description":"有條件通過環評審查","date":"2003","date_precision":"year","source_url":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1aESMD2YyrOcKd0f3XAaOcNhAz_ENo3vd/edit?gid=1996964847#gid=1996964847&range=A1","sort_order":2,"status":"","is_published":false},{"title":"公告確認通過","description":"公告確認通過","date":"2011","date_precision":"year","source_url":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1aESMD2YyrOcKd0f3XAaOcNhAz_ENo3vd/edit?gid=1996964847#gid=1996964847&range=A1","sort_order":3,"status":"","is_published":false},{"title":"開發單位與環保署進行8年訴訟","description":"原始日期：2003-2011\n開發單位與環保署進行8年訴訟","date":"","date_precision":"unknown","source_url":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1aESMD2YyrOcKd0f3XAaOcNhAz_ENo3vd/edit?gid=1996964847#gid=1996964847&range=A1","sort_order":4,"status":"","is_published":false},{"title":"確認通過環評","description":"確認通過環評","date":"2011","date_precision":"year","source_url":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1aESMD2YyrOcKd0f3XAaOcNhAz_ENo3vd/edit?gid=1996964847#gid=1996964847&range=A1","sort_order":5,"status":"","is_published":false},{"title":"再提出「宜蘭大溪蜜月灣整體開發計畫」","description":"再提出「宜蘭大溪蜜月灣整體開發計畫」","date":"2014-04","date_precision":"month","source_url":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1aESMD2YyrOcKd0f3XAaOcNhAz_ENo3vd/edit?gid=1996964847#gid=1996964847&range=A1","sort_order":6,"status":"","is_published":false},{"title":"《海岸管理法》通過","description":"《海岸管理法》通過","date":"2015","date_precision":"year","source_url":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1aESMD2YyrOcKd0f3XAaOcNhAz_ENo3vd/edit?gid=1996964847#gid=1996964847&range=A1","sort_order":7,"status":"","is_published":false},{"title":"再進交通部觀光局審理，由於飯店開發離海這麼近，守護自然海岸、保護海洋生態的憂患意識抬頭，《海岸管理法》也已於立法院通過；再加上2011年開發單位博愛企業核定的環","description":"再進交通部觀光局審理，由於飯店開發離海這麼近，守護自然海岸、保護海洋生態的憂患意識抬頭，《海岸管理法》也已於立法院通過；再加上2011年開發單位博愛企業核定的環說書定稿，依據的是2003年的環境條件，引發暫停審查及該不該重啟環評或環差論戰。會議做成不繼續開會、開發單位兩周內提出修正兩項結論；對此令人摸不著頭緒的結論，宜蘭縣政府表示不滿意，極力主張全案「重返環評現場」。\n大溪蜜月灣開發計畫 海岸保護、環境衝擊說不清：https://e-info.org.tw/node/105685","date":"2015-03-06","date_precision":"day","source_url":"https://e-info.org.tw/node/105685","sort_order":8,"status":"","is_published":false},{"title":"宜蘭大溪蜜月灣開發計劃，環保署認為開發單位常常實問虛答，且提出的報告有許多東西還未釐清，要求開發單位在9月30日以前，補件再審。","description":"宜蘭大溪蜜月灣開發計劃，環保署認為開發單位常常實問虛答，且提出的報告有許多東西還未釐清，要求開發單位在9月30日以前，補件再審。\n宜蘭蜜月灣環差 9/30前補件再審：https://www.cna.com.tw/news/asoc/201606300410.aspx","date":"2016-06-30","date_precision":"day","source_url":"https://www.cna.com.tw/news/asoc/201606300410.aspx","sort_order":9,"status":"","is_published":false},{"title":"環保署決議重新環評。會議最終有環評委員認為此開發案變更涉及別墅區、旅館區、住宅區等主要開發區域的建築數量、空間配置、道路規劃的調整有增加整地影響程度之虞。且主要","description":"環保署決議重新環評。會議最終有環評委員認為此開發案變更涉及別墅區、旅館區、住宅區等主要開發區域的建築數量、空間配置、道路規劃的調整有增加整地影響程度之虞。且主要開發區坐落於自然度4以上的次生林生長區域，此外，開發單位的生態現況指出，種類有增加趨勢，因此需擬定相關因應對策等因素，因此決議此案需重新辦理環境影響評估。\n問題過多待補件 環保署：蜜月灣重啟環評\n蜜月灣開發案 環保署決議重新環評：https://e-info.org.tw/node/201723","date":"2016-12-08","date_precision":"day","source_url":"https://e-info.org.tw/node/201723","sort_order":10,"status":"","is_published":false}],"media":[],"area_m2":1074000.0,"investment_ntd":6000000000.0},"snapshot":{"source_feature_id":"mymaps-a073f31b1fb1","source_format":"development-handoff-2026-11-04","source_sha256":{"development_cases.csv":"2054df0f253078988062ec83d8d97c127c9c28bf718e47ebb943afef8276859d","development_case_timeline.csv":"38f579878e66decdb65c6bc6d4f9eec78b2b0e1008298f13b6d77ced9d2a1b0d","development_case_timeline_source.csv":"6ad0fc4a5c0e9dde406fb4809b921b612af1281d225d44e1ce66f2d5c3a00e8f","development_case_media.csv":"2566c213f26d7bade4579edf410597141b0d1ab73d2cde4b693a4042249aa7ef","development_case_source.csv":"97f73144deb6b48524c1adb3270483008da4b01b14fd5b35e5a15ec69296d2ce","development_case_discrepancy.csv":"c1c337b9b03d0be56218acf1685176d78d6d686c4f284a9081081fad9555859e"},"case":{"source_feature_id":"mymaps-a073f31b1fb1","source_order":"2","source_layer":"海岸開發案（觀光）","source_title":"宜蘭大溪蜜月灣地區開發計畫（重新環評）","name":"宜蘭大溪蜜月灣地區開發計畫","status_raw":"重新環評","summary_text":"2011年已通過環境影響評估，至今仍未開發。開發單位與反對開發的宜蘭縣府、民意代表與當地居民就是否應該重辦環評展開激烈攻防。","description_text":"2011年已通過環境影響評估，至今仍未開發。開發單位與反對開發的宜蘭縣府、民意代表與當地居民就是否應該重辦環評展開激烈攻防。\n詳細資料與大事紀：https://reurl.cc/QNgRxZ","detail_url":"https://reurl.cc/QNgRxZ","geometry_type":"Polygon","longitude":"","latitude":"","geometry_geojson":"{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[121.88944,24.938057],[121.887295,24.936734],[121.885492,24.937201],[121.881372,24.936967],[121.879827,24.931675],[121.879312,24.928017],[121.879913,24.926382],[121.883261,24.925059],[121.883604,24.924125],[121.88532,24.924358],[121.886007,24.925682],[121.887724,24.925682],[121.890814,24.937201],[121.88944,24.938057]]]}","media_urls_json":"[]","source_map_mid":"1dKET9H80jrHy2g_fvY49rkMFux4nLRs","source_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/d/viewer?mid=1dKET9H80jrHy2g_fvY49rkMFux4nLRs","detail_name":"宜蘭大溪蜜月灣地區開發計畫","issue_start_time_raw":"2003年","county":"宜蘭縣","competent_authority":"東北角暨宜蘭海岸國家風景區管理處審查","environmental_authority":"環保署","area_scale_raw":"107.4公頃\n250間客房的旅館區、別墅區、海濱遊憩區、野餐烤肉露營區、溪畔親水遊憩設施等","area_ha":"107.4","investment_amount_raw":"60億","investment_twd":"6000000000","developer":"博愛企業公司","detail_status_raw":"重新環評","detail_summary_text":"2011年已通過環境影響評估，至今仍未開發。根據蜜月灣提出的環差報告，將設置別墅區、住宅區及250間客房的旅館區，開發面積總共107.4公頃，是東北部地區最大的開發案。經營計劃分為4期、2階段開發，開發期程為15年。","detail_sheet_name":"02宜蘭大溪蜜月灣地區開發計畫","detail_sheet_gid":"1996964847","detail_sheet_url":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1aESMD2YyrOcKd0f3XAaOcNhAz_ENo3vd/edit?gid=1996964847#gid=1996964847&range=A1","detail_source_row":"2","master_location":"東海岸","master_county":"宜蘭縣","master_name":"宜蘭大溪蜜月灣開發計畫","development_nature":"民間投資","review_progress_raw":"重辦環評","permit_progress_raw":"","master_competent_authority":"交通部觀光局東北角海岸國家風景區管理處","jurisdiction_level":"地方","master_environmental_authority":"環保署","master_area_scale_raw":"107.4公頃（陸域80.89公頃、近岸海域26.51公頃）","master_area_ha":"107.4","facilities_raw":"別墅區、住宅區、旅館區、海岸發展區、保護區","master_investment_amount_raw":"60億","master_investment_twd":"6000000000","master_notes":"為台灣東部開發規模最大、斥資60億元、面積逾百公頃的開發計畫，此計畫於民國87年進行環評審查，民國92年有條件通過環評審查，民國100年公告確認通過，今年送環差報告至環保署審查。","controversy_text":"環評書面為20年前資料與現況不符、基地位於土石流潛勢區與石壁溪圍繞、開發挖填土石的面積將超過10%","related_report_label":"問題過多待補件 環保署：蜜月灣重啟環評/環境資訊中心","related_report_url":"https://e-info.org.tw/node/201723","master_source_row":"4"},"related":{"development_case_timeline.csv":[{"event_key":"timeline-ed39e61c8e1467c9","source_feature_id":"mymaps-a073f31b1fb1","source_order":"1","event_date_raw":"1998","event_date_start":"1998-01-01","event_date_end":"1998-12-31","date_precision":"year","phase_label":"","event_text":"宜蘭大溪蜜月灣進行環評審查","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"02宜蘭大溪蜜月灣地區開發計畫","source_sheet_gid":"1996964847","source_row":"7"},{"event_key":"timeline-53a587005eb686c5","source_feature_id":"mymaps-a073f31b1fb1","source_order":"2","event_date_raw":"2003","event_date_start":"2003-01-01",