2dluSPpILGfnm-82kvU8ShxjxFF1lnCC6mSFVCqr_U_AVWBGCqDPgaoF-G_kV0ihXMHA75xAn61P2wSfn_N1lemq18JFuP1L381E0_xqIrIQVsIA8J4x354bv906Esso5goi65LG5H8CmpT7vENjfV62R0eidGuHWlke_-MQa7lc8X1_Lb7Pck-RcpUogy_y-NMU7y9HkS7DJncYhNeIGP0974Ljg_4VOX3L0w8DGTiBtw6xnsi-8F2hCRyBA_CbX_tz-sDEbC_3_4AAirQCcdnD85Ue3ppIgGykRmlYcm8RZzUB9nJqez4ra9P4Cyl2ygVLiYdbQpqkkLCKLSKjvi9tiMulfDyPYSfHbJmN_3syyVezH1HyRbdgK06pYJTkDTd02tkaXoh4y18eyu9RhNA7ZopHmcSuKfmOCrVHrjUaf-_lQiwVDE1-AHl4F2wrkZKE0KvnKgehATS9qeQIeM6ZP6aMWa-fK7Guwp4xbEA3F13AObk38NmYHxNzyZ8aDH87Y6i5ISotzAyWYxFuagCsYphz8zP8Kc9c5_ekAvwbLQdAgwyUF15hUZ2zE7l0pLOU_m7PwGi3iIPP6bH2XKK4pgIY0gWxCviBaPLO9vMn1MC66N_zAfS0-7AM8ZqNHRVczGSnQVJTtaTf2530OW-q41cTbdS8xOCNQwPNevkKwHBRvFNryfyL9CebEaKyDEzyiqv9friUkWhJCMfaHiXFpLywfYLO_WkQ6Oyv5YV6jNCmp2_SL-k3UsGkyk6pqqyuXJiZscLJmpn6_ZwUTeLp8y2jz1Dlsx-93d9Okv9guOsjbziitdWYHm7vI1mjLS\"]","source_map_mid":"1dKET9H80jrHy2g_fvY49rkMFux4nLRs","source_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/d/viewer?mid=1dKET9H80jrHy2g_fvY49rkMFux4nLRs","detail_name":"台東縣成功鎮滿地富遊樂區開發計畫","issue_start_time_raw":"","county":"台東縣","competent_authority":"交通部觀光局/中央","environmental_authority":"環保署","area_scale_raw":"10.5公頃","area_ha":"10.5","investment_amount_raw":"約11億","investment_twd":"1100000000","developer":"","detail_status_raw":"已完成環評\n2024-08-06 第四次海審會 要求6個月內補件，提請大會審議。","detail_summary_text":"「滿地富遊樂區」是政府二十年前（2002）為了促進觀光發展而粗糙通過環評的開發案。業主在2002年取得環評並完成水土保持、整地等基礎建設後，遂因經濟不景氣、土地收購合併等因素暫停施工十餘年，如今準備正式向台東縣府申請建照，動工在即。\n\n依環評法第16-1條，環評通過後三年若未動工，開發單位應向環保署提出「環境差異分析報告」而非只是簡易的「開發變更對照表」，雖然本案因曾動工而不構成16-1之條件，但情境等同於十年未動工。\n\n其他環保團體及在地居民也擔憂，滿地富遊樂區位於花東沿海保護區中的「一般保護區」，距離海岸僅十數公尺，不僅與另一大型開發案「寶盛水族生態遊樂區」相連，更緊鄰法規更嚴謹的「比西里岸（三仙台）沿海自然保護區」。若貿然動工，可能對自然環境造成不可逆的傷害。","detail_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","detail_sheet_gid":"1734468693","detail_sheet_url":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1aESMD2YyrOcKd0f3XAaOcNhAz_ENo3vd/edit?gid=1734468693#gid=1734468693&range=A1","detail_source_row":"2","master_location":"東海岸","master_county":"台東縣","master_name":"滿地富遊樂區","development_nature":"民間投資","review_progress_raw":"尚未開發（已通過環評）","permit_progress_raw":"2024-08-06 第四次海審會 \n要求6個月內補件再審","master_competent_authority":"交通部觀光局","jurisdiction_level":"中央","master_environmental_authority":"環保署","master_area_scale_raw":"10公頃","master_area_ha":"10","facilities_raw":"200間客房、各式遊憩設施","master_investment_amount_raw":"11億","master_investment_twd":"1100000000","master_notes":"(1)91年通過環評，93年水保及整地完工，隨後不再動作，規避環評法16-1條。\n(2)110年依海岸管理法進行海岸審議會，尚在審議中","controversy_text":"20年前通過的環評已無實質效力、原住民族生活區域、10公頃建體未評估海岸景觀影響","related_report_label":"","related_report_url":"","master_source_row":"16"},"related":{"development_case_timeline.csv":[{"event_key":"timeline-c4971d64e59b3faa","source_feature_id":"mymaps-de351bdb8c2d","source_order":"1","event_date_raw":"2001","event_date_start":"2001-01-01","event_date_end":"2001-12-31","date_precision":"year","phase_label":"","event_text":"「滿地富遊樂區」提出環評申請","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","source_sheet_gid":"1734468693","source_row":"7"},{"event_key":"timeline-08024f8f1af500d3","source_feature_id":"mymaps-de351bdb8c2d","source_order":"2","event_date_raw":"2002","event_date_start":"2002-01-01","event_date_end":"2002-12-31","date_precision":"year","phase_label":"","event_text":"通過環評並完成水土保持工程設施後，因經濟不景氣，暫停施工。","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","source_sheet_gid":"1734468693","source_row":"8"},{"event_key":"timeline-76fbfe24ed504522","source_feature_id":"mymaps-de351bdb8c2d","source_order":"3","event_date_raw":"2006.01.18","event_date_start":"2006-01-18","event_date_end":"2006-01-18","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"台東縣政府完成土地變更程序，土地由62筆合併為130 筆，計畫範圍不變（10.5公頃）。","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","source_sheet_gid":"1734468693","source_row":"9"},{"event_key":"timeline-f363e74efaaa5a1e","source_feature_id":"mymaps-de351bdb8c2d","source_order":"4","event_date_raw":"2009.01","event_date_start":"2009-01-01","event_date_end":"2009-01-31","date_precision":"month","phase_label":"","event_text":"於2003.12~2004.03、2004.06~2008.10共兩次未依法執行環境監測，環保署於2009.01合併開罰30萬","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","source_sheet_gid":"1734468693","source_row":"10"},{"event_key":"timeline-1025eccf64d8986e","source_feature_id":"mymaps-de351bdb8c2d","source_order":"5","event_date_raw":"2009","event_date_start":"2009-01-01","event_date_end":"2009-12-31","date_precision":"year","phase_label":"","event_text":"配合台東縣政府土地變更，依環評施行細則37條辦理，滿地富向環保署提出第一次「開發內容變更對照表」","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","source_sheet_gid":"1734468693","source_row":"11"},{"event_key":"timeline-e4e2d068e3940c05","source_feature_id":"mymaps-de351bdb8c2d","source_order":"6","event_date_raw":"2012.01.06","event_date_start":"2012-01-06","event_date_end":"2012-01-06","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"東海岸風景管理處辦理部分土地拓寬，滿地富公司提供部分土地作為芝田路拓寬使用","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","source_sheet_gid":"1734468693","source_row":"12"},{"event_key":"timeline-4b0f4280d7c5c5e2","source_feature_id":"mymaps-de351bdb8c2d","source_order":"7","event_date_raw":"2012.12~2013.10","event_date_start":"2012-12-01","event_date_end":"2013-10-31","date_precision":"range","phase_label":"","event_text":"滿地富向環保署申請停工","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","source_sheet_gid":"1734468693","source_row":"13"},{"event_key":"timeline-6d159075ee2c57ee","source_feature_id":"mymaps-de351bdb8c2d","source_order":"8","event_date_raw":"2014.02","event_date_start":"2014-02-01","event_date_end":"2014-02-28","date_precision":"month","phase_label":"","event_text":"環保署核准滿地富停工申請","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","source_sheet_gid":"1734468693","source_row":"14"},{"event_key":"timeline-5ad119814963dda7","source_feature_id":"mymaps-de351bdb8c2d","source_order":"9","event_date_raw":"2014.02.05","event_date_start":"2014-02-05","event_date_end":"2014-02-05","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"第一次變更內容對照表審查通過","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","source_sheet_gid":"1734468693","source_row":"15"},{"event_key":"timeline-38f27837624eb4ff","source_feature_id":"mymaps-de351bdb8c2d","source_order":"10","event_date_raw":"2014.07.24","event_date_start":"2014-07-24","event_date_end":"2014-07-24","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"滿地富向台東縣政府申請建造執照","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","source_sheet_gid":"1734468693","source_row":"16"},{"event_key":"timeline-c2ff941b2f50c655","source_feature_id":"mymaps-de351bdb8c2d","source_order":"11","event_date_raw":"2014.11.14","event_date_start":"2014-11-14","event_date_end":"2014-11-14","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"第二次變更對照表第一次初審，因土地變更供芝田路拓寬，依環評施行細則37條辦理。\n\n環保署進行「台東縣成功鎮『滿地富遊樂區開發計畫』環境影響說明書變更內容對照表」第一次專案小組審查會議。審查結果，主席裁示請開發單位再釐清相關用地及主管機關問題，再做審查。但因對照表審查無關乎是否動工，開發單位表示，無論如何都會動工。","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","source_sheet_gid":"1734468693","source_row":"17"},{"event_key":"timeline-24c36e0afe6ef253","source_feature_id":"mymaps-de351bdb8c2d","source_order":"12","event_date_raw":"2015.10.07","event_date_start":"2015-10-07","event_date_end":"2015-10-07","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"變更對照表第二次審查，台東基翬、比西里岸部落的阿美族人特地從三仙台到環保署抗議","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","source_sheet_gid":"1734468693","source_row":"18"},{"event_key":"timeline-255704b8d34921ea","source_feature_id":"mymaps-de351bdb8c2d","source_order":"13","event_date_raw":"2018.02.18","event_date_start":"2018-02-18","event_date_end":"2018-02-18","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"環保署舉行台東成功鎮「滿地富」遊樂區變更內容對照表第三次初審。此次變更是由於調整基地範圍與配置，面對過去部分土地用地編定問題造成開發延宕，業者提出無償提供數筆土地作為保安用地作解，開發面積因此小幅下修，小組以「對環境影響輕微」建議通過此案。","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","source_sheet_gid":"1734468693","source_row":"19"},{"event_key":"timeline-b40907e798472f23","source_feature_id":"mymaps-de351bdb8c2d","source_order":"14","event_date_raw":"2021.04.15","event_date_start":"2021-04-15","event_date_end":"2021-04-15","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"滿地富第一次海審會","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","source_sheet_gid":"1734468693","source_row":"20"},{"event_key":"timeline-3e52b222cfd809cc","source_feature_id":"mymaps-de351bdb8c2d","source_order":"15","event_date_raw":"2021.12.08","event_date_start":"2021-12-08","event_date_end":"2021-12-08","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"滿地富由營建署召開第二次海審會，地球公民基金會提出資料證實，滿地富土地即將以4億遭到法拍（詳附件一），質疑案件為何繼續送審。","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","source_sheet_gid":"1734468693","source_row":"21"},{"event_key":"timeline-250f56b8536efa49","source_feature_id":"mymaps-de351bdb8c2d","source_order":"16","event_date_raw":"2022.08.05","event_date_start":"2022-08-05","event_date_end":"2022-08-05","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"由於《海岸管理法》於2015年上路，2021年在營建署海岸管理審議會要求下首次於台東縣成功鎮召開說明會，近150人的周邊部落族人與成功鎮民，及長期關注本案的環團、原住民團體都出席參加。\n\n面對當地部落代表的質疑，以及對環境影響的疑慮，開發商代表現場無法給出具體回應。部落青年會高舉「基翬不積灰」等標語，要求「撤回滿地富開發案」，場面一度僵持，最後，開發商執行顧問吳守哲僅表示會將意見帶回公司討論，結束本次說明會。","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","source_sheet_gid":"1734468693","source_row":"22"},{"event_key":"timeline-31f0fe1e66bd6646","source_feature_id":"mymaps-de351bdb8c2d","source_order":"17","event_date_raw":"2023.02.18","event_date_start":"2023-02-18","event_date_end":"2023-02-18","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"台東縣成功鎮「滿地富遊樂區」最早於2002年即已通過環評，不過歷經在地民眾、環保團體20年抗爭，目前1萬多坪土地仍是荒草一片，且近期又出現在法拍市場，一拍底價高達10億5450萬元，衝破台東縣法拍市場有史以來最高總價。","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","source_sheet_gid":"1734468693","source_row":"23"},{"event_key":"timeline-42f933ba9691b396","source_feature_id":"mymaps-de351bdb8c2d","source_order":"18","event_date_raw":"2024.08.06","event_date_start":"2024-08-06","event_date_end":"2024-08-06","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"第四次海審會 要求6個月內補件再審","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"07台東滿地富","source_sheet_gid":"1734468693","source_row":"24"}],"development_case_timeline_source.csv":[{"timeline_source_key":"timeline-source-654bc9c91e354d06","event_key":"timeline-08024f8f1af500d3","source_feature