aster_area_ha":"6.9","facilities_raw":"由原本的327間減為241間","master_investment_amount_raw":"","master_investment_twd":"","master_notes":"","controversy_text":"長期以來部落居民很擔心自來水源不足，如今要開發成將近7公頃的渡假村，擔心會造成搶水；開發基地緊鄰該土石流潛勢路段，未來除有大量體的開發工程外，還有每天400多公噸大量回收廢水澆灌在上升帶的黏土層上，崩滑現象恐怕會不斷循環，非工程手段所能解決。","related_report_label":"都蘭渡假村開發案捲土重來 召開說明會","related_report_url":"https://news.ipcf.org.tw/75833","master_source_row":"21"},"related":{"development_case_timeline.csv":[{"event_key":"timeline-59e8e1bfa444044a","source_feature_id":"mymaps-5e213d69d4ab","source_order":"1","event_date_raw":"2016.07.05","event_date_start":"2016-07-05","event_date_end":"2016-07-05","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"環境影響說明會","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"12台東都蘭ATT","source_sheet_gid":"861272251","source_row":"7"},{"event_key":"timeline-1287eea09e7f98a6","source_feature_id":"mymaps-5e213d69d4ab","source_order":"2","event_date_raw":"2018年","event_date_start":"2018-01-01","event_date_end":"2018-12-31","date_precision":"year","phase_label":"","event_text":"因諸多疑慮未與地方溝通，遭台東縣府環評會議決議退回目的事業主管機關。是台東大型開發案首次遭到台東縣政府環評委員會退回","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"12台東都蘭ATT","source_sheet_gid":"861272251","source_row":"8"},{"event_key":"timeline-358a861107672695","source_feature_id":"mymaps-5e213d69d4ab","source_order":"3","event_date_raw":"2019年","event_date_start":"2019-01-01","event_date_end":"2019-12-31","date_precision":"year","phase_label":"","event_text":"舉行地方交流座談會，提出敦親睦鄰及回饋計畫，但業者對民眾疑慮未完整回應，且現場要求長輩簽同意書，引發地方不滿。","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"12台東都蘭ATT","source_sheet_gid":"861272251","source_row":"9"},{"event_key":"timeline-bbcbf56379bba99b","source_feature_id":"mymaps-5e213d69d4ab","source_order":"4","event_date_raw":"2023.04.20","event_date_start":"2023-04-20","event_date_end":"2023-04-20","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"召開地方說明會。居民、環團在說明會上提出用水、廢水、是否真的會提供就業機會給在地年輕人及地質為黏土層等問題，廠商並沒有正面回覆。台東縣政府也說會扮監督角色。","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"12台東都蘭ATT","source_sheet_gid":"861272251","source_row":"10"},{"event_key":"timeline-b453e3b87a7c8875","source_feature_id":"mymaps-5e213d69d4ab","source_order":"5","event_date_raw":"2024.06.12","event_date_start":"2024-06-12","event_date_end":"2024-06-12","date_precision":"day","phase_label":"","event_text":"環評審查要求補件再審。\n\n評委員對於ATT集團的規劃提出了多達12點缺漏，包括每人每日用水量被低估到不合理的量，而高達1億元的自來水延管擴建經費自來水公司也難以負擔，延管工程更會推遲5~10年的開發時程。開發單位也忽略了考古遺址的重要性評估。回收後的廢水如果發生溢流會如何影響自然水體更沒有交待。而聯外交通更沒有妥善的規劃，難以應付緊急疏散的需求。地質鑽探的結果也沒有合理解釋。在崩塌區域更沒有加強鑽探確保下方公路安全。附近河川及珊瑚礁具獨特生態價值，但開發商缺乏相關生態調查。","note_text":"","source_sheet_name":"12台東都蘭ATT","source_sheet_gid":"861272251","source_row":"11"}],"development_case_timeline_source.csv":[{"timeline_source_key":"timeline-source-d6a796c8d8838e60","event_key":"timeline-59e8e1bfa444044a","source_feature_id":"mymaps-5e213d69d4ab","sort_order":"1","source_label":"500個房間的渡假村「無水可用」，環評竟讓它過關…","source_url":"https://www.businessweekly.com.tw/focus/indep/29069","source_sheet_name":"12台東都蘭ATT","source_sheet_gid":"861272251","source_row":"7"},{"timeline_source_key":"timeline-source-5143d6a5c2c20c14","event_key":"timeline-1287eea09e7f98a6","source_feature_id":"mymaps-5e213d69d4ab","sort_order":"2","source_label":"海岸開發:都蘭ATT將捲土重來","source_url":"https://www.cet-taiwan.org/node/3438","source_sheet_name":"12台東都蘭ATT","source_sheet_gid":"861272251","source_row":"8"},{"timeline_source_key":"timeline-source-d147ca8b7e20a2ed","event_key":"timeline-358a861107672695","source_feature_id":"mymaps-5e213d69d4ab","sort_order":"3","source_label":"都蘭開發ATT渡假村 環團有疑慮","source_url":"https://e-info.org.tw/node/217842","source_sheet_name":"12台東都蘭ATT","source_sheet_gid":"861272251","source_row":"9"},{"timeline_source_key":"timeline-source-7ebebf98c7681730","event_key":"timeline-bbcbf56379bba99b","source_feature_id":"mymaps-5e213d69d4ab","sort_order":"4","source_label":"都蘭渡假村開發案捲土重來 召開說明會","source_url":"https://news.ipcf.org.tw/75833","source_sheet_name":"12台東都蘭ATT","source_sheet_gid":"861272251","source_row":"10"},{"timeline_source_key":"timeline-sourc